      subtitle: "",
      location: "CUHK Shenzhen Research Institute (SZRI)",
      content: ["EduAIR and CUHK Jockey Club AI for the Future Project jointly organized the Greater Bay Area AI for the Future Experiential Camp 2024 in the Greater Bay Area at the CUHK Shenzhen Research Institute on 19 August, 2024. More than 300 students and teachers from Hong Kong and the Mainland participated in the event, and students from both places actively participated in various activities through group cooperation. This camp was rich in content, with different sessions designed for students: Workshop on Generative AI for exploring the latest AI technology; Hands-on Workshop on Exploring the Mysteries of AI Model Training, for learning how to train AI models; Hands-on Workshop on AI Model and AI Car Practicing for assembling the AI cars and applying the AI models to AI cars; And AI Car Challenge for testing the results of students' training throughout the day, and further deepen the friendship between students from two places. The event also featured the Greater Bay Area Teacher Forum for teachers from two places to exchange their experience in AI education. We believe that this experiential camp will further promote the in-depth integration of the AI field in the Greater Bay Area."],
