      subtitle: "",
      location: "The Chinese University of Hong Kong",
      content: ["EduAIR was honoured to support the AI Hackathon 2025, organised by CUHK Jockey Club AI for the Future Project, which successfully concluded on 21 August, 2025. The event attracted up to 350 students from across Hong Kong to compete together.", "The competition included: 1) pre-competition participation from participating students through online Python learning resources designed by our team, helping them master basic syntax and coding logic, covering concepts such as variables, conditionals, relational operators, lists, loops, functions, and libraries; 2) On the day of the competition, students applied their knowledge to complete a series of challenging tasks, showcasing their innovative thinking and practical skills. Through this competition, we hope to foster interest in artificial intelligence and basic programming skills among secondary school students, while also cultivating their problem-solving skills and teamwork."],
