      title: "STEAM Day at SKH St. Simon's Lui Ming Choi Secondary School",
      subtitle: "",
      location: "SKH St. Simon's Lui Ming Choi Secondary School",
      content: ["EduAIR was delighted to organise a three-day STEAM Day for SKH St. Simon's Lui Ming Choi Secondary School from 4 to 6 May 2026. The programme offered a rich combination of theoretical learning and hands-on experiences, enabling students to explore innovative technologies such as artificial intelligence, robotics, drones, and 3D printing through immersive activities.", "One of the key highlights was the RoboMaster competition. Through robotic vehicle battles, students applied logical thinking, strategic planning, teamwork, and real-time problem-solving skills. In the AI and drone programming workshop, students explored the application of intelligent technologies through coding and drone control.", "The AI ambient light workshop combined artificial intelligence with creative design, allowing students to create their own smart lighting products. The event also featured AI exhibits, robotic arm demonstrations, and an AI-generated 3D printing workshop, enabling students to experience the complete innovation journey from creative ideation to physical production.", "EduAIR is committed to designing inspiring, interactive, and practical learning experiences for schools. This STEAM Day not only introduced students to emerging technologies, but also encouraged them to build an innovative mindset through exploration, collaboration, and hands-on practice."],
